ers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested this PR. It works as expected and looks good to me overall. Two nitpicky suggestions:\n- Integrate the enable checkbox as described above.\n- I'm a _bit_ bothered by the name 'Auto Font Size' and would rather name this to include the word 'fit', I think? How about… `Resize Font to Fit`?","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116791#pullrequestreview-3872639919","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116791","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116791#pullrequestreview-3872639919"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116791"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-01T16:22:36Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3895049848,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7oKb54","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested this a lot more and found two bugs:\n\n- On a Label, when `Resize Font to Fit` is enabled and `Autowrap Mode` is set to `Word (Smart)`, the Control can be resized to smaller than the minimum height of the Label making the text disappear entirely – whereas, if `Resize Font to Fit` is disabled, the height can never be smaller than the font height.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9b9cb2e3-11fe-4300-9ab3-cf439f040550\n\nWe should retain the original behavior; text should always be visible, so minimum height should always be enforced.\n\n- On a RichTextLabel, if you have both `Fit Content` and `Resize Font to Fit` enabled, you can only grow the Control but never shrink it.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/899ea7e0-0b9a-4e30-bba2-34521658e651\n\nThe expected behavior is that you are able to shrink it to the point where the minimum size is achieved.\n\n- Other than that, works great.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116791#pullrequestreview-3895049848","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116791","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116791#pullrequestreview-3895049848"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116791"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-05T09:14:56Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3904138167,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7otGu3","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"LGTM. Needs a code review.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116791#pullrequestreview-3904138167","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116791","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116791#pullrequestreview-3904138167"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116791"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-06T14:46:46Z","commit_id":"08d2b865763c943c90e29c9bb58242a09f3c6eab"},{"id":4033762704,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7wblWQ","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally (rebased on top of `master` 06c3946e3501a7f52a10eed96d200b93df17d373), it mostly works as expected. Code looks good to me.\n\nExample on the [RichTextLabel demo](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/gui/rich_text_bbcode):\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c205f51f-0e25-458a-91c9-06282b15d531\n\nSome feedback:\n\n- Dropcap (the yellow `F`) and list bullets do not automatically resize, unlike font sizes overridden with `font_size` (which are scaled relative to the theme font size, e.g. `24` is 150% of the default `16`). I consider this a bug, so it'd be good to fix if possible.\n\nList bullets in the table as seen below with a small automatic font size:\n\n<img width=\"451\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1bfaf260-3196-4c2a-8ae8-cef7045f0390\" />\n\n- If floating-point font sizes were supported, fonts could rescale more smoothly and take the full horizontal space of the label more optimally, especially at low font sizes. See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/87243.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116791#pullrequestreview-4033762704","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116791","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116791#pullrequestreview-4033762704"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116791"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-30T23:18:21Z","commit_id":"08d2b865763c943c90e29c9bb58242a09f3c6eab"},{"id":4091836231,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7z5HdH","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?u=a27600b43b5278ada0f7abc144fcb1b615bdef8e&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This works fine with simple embedded images using the new `em` tag\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e327ab8d-c90b-4b9d-8ba6-5e140b1cb24b\n\nBut fails once you combine the new `em` and existing `font_size` tag, as you can see in the video below, the 2D icon in the large text only scales up to the `maximum_font_size` instead of scaling up to `maximum_font_size * p_base_font_size / theme_cache.normal_font_size`\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c77b31cf-5c1f-4e8e-a688-ed3629085cd2\n\nYou probably need to touch these two lines that were added by #112617:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/1aabcb9e9bc7a222a972731523831ec86b77ee20/scene/gui/rich_text_label.cpp#L563\nhttps://gi